sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-graner-cellular-potts-cell-sorting> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-graner-cellular-potts-cell-sorting-model-fidelity> .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-graner-cellular-potts-cell-sorting-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Graner & Glazier (1992) / Glazier & Graner (1993) extended large-Q Cellular Potts Model cell sorting + Ouchi et al. (2003) cortical tension — Model fidelity to source: 76/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Credited: the surface tension relations (`compute_cpm_tensions`, L109-154) match PRL Eqs. 2-3; the single-site Metropolis copy kernel (L502-588) carries the exact adhesion + quadratic volume Hamiltonian of PRL Eq. 1 with the Glazier & Graner (1993) Eq. 2 acceptance rule (P = 1 for dH <= 0, exp(-dH/T) otherwise, strictly negative only at T = 0); the Pass 3 Ouchi et al. (2003) term is correct in form (8-neighbour bond-count perimeter, Delta_p parity laws L562-563, energy delta L199-206, bookkeeping verified drift-free) and lambda_P = 0 recovers the v2 lattice bit-for-bit (self-test check 9). Deductions (all pre-date Pass 3, missed in v2): a whole-cell identity-swap move exchanges `cell_type` between two random cells 8 times per MCS under a separate Metropolis rule at temperature 2.5 T (L467-500); this teleports cell identity without any lattice motion and is not part of the Graner-Glazier formalism in which sorting arises from single-site copies alone (-10); the 'partial sorting lens' regime is not an emergent consequence of gamma_LD > gamma_DM - gamma_LM but is manufactured by a 1.8 * x lateral bias added inside that swap move (L494-497), and the realised A2 configuration is a concentric core-shell (Delta_r = +0.352, centroid offset 0.21), not a lens (-5); cells equilibrate at mean v = 12.1 = 75.6 % of V_t (RMS 5.16) because lambda = 1.2 is weak against J ~ 14-16, and a hard `vols <= 6` veto outside the Hamiltonian (L530-531; 3 cells sit on it) prevents the cell loss this would otherwise cause (-4); `depinning_prob` (L451-454) is computed from the §III.B pinning argument and never used, so the T = 0 arrest is a property of the acceptance rule, not of the documented factor (-2); lattice edges are excluded from copy attempts (L524-525) so medium contact at the boundary is never sampled (-1)." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "1992-graner-cellular-potts-cell-sorting.py L451–L454: depinning_prob computed and never used (dead code) <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/654cd6fc/1992-graner-cellular-potts-cell-sorting.py#L451-L454>",
            "1992-graner-cellular-potts-cell-sorting.py L467–L500: Whole-cell cell_type identity swap, 8 attempts per MCS, own Metropolis rule at 2.5 T — not in the Graner-Glazier single-site formalism <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/654cd6fc/1992-graner-cellular-potts-cell-sorting.py#L467-L500>",
            "1992-graner-cellular-potts-cell-sorting.py L494–L497: is_partial lateral bias 1.8 * x manufactures the 'lens' regime; A2 realised as concentric core-shell Delta_r = +0.352 <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/654cd6fc/1992-graner-cellular-potts-cell-sorting.py#L494-L497>",
            "1992-graner-cellular-potts-cell-sorting.py L530–L531: Hard vols <= 6 veto outside the Hamiltonian; cells at 75.6 % of V_t with 3 cells on the floor <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/654cd6fc/1992-graner-cellular-potts-cell-sorting.py#L530-L531>" ;
        pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-graner-cellular-potts-cell-sorting-model-fidelity-1>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-graner-cellular-potts-cell-sorting-model-fidelity-2>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-graner-cellular-potts-cell-sorting-model-fidelity-3>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-graner-cellular-potts-cell-sorting-model-fidelity-4> ;
        pk:hasScore "0.76"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "mostly faithful" .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-graner-cellular-potts-cell-sorting-model-fidelity-1> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "1992-graner-cellular-potts-cell-sorting.py L109–L154" ;
        dct:description "Exact PRL Eqs. 2-3 surface tensions and four-regime classifier" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/654cd6fc/1992-graner-cellular-potts-cell-sorting.py#L109-L154> .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-graner-cellular-potts-cell-sorting-model-fidelity-2> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "1992-graner-cellular-potts-cell-sorting.py L502–L588" ;
        dct:description "Single-site Metropolis copy kernel: adhesion + quadratic volume + Pass 3 perimeter term with Glazier & Graner (1993) Eq. 2 acceptance" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/654cd6fc/1992-graner-cellular-potts-cell-sorting.py#L502-L588> .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-graner-cellular-potts-cell-sorting-model-fidelity-3> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "1992-graner-cellular-potts-cell-sorting.py L199–L206" ;
        dct:description "perimeter_energy_delta = lambda_P dp (2 (p - P_t) + dp), Ouchi et al. (2003) Eq. 2 single-copy form matching Lean cpm_delta_perim" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/654cd6fc/1992-graner-cellular-potts-cell-sorting.py#L199-L206> .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-graner-cellular-potts-cell-sorting-model-fidelity-4> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_042_cellular_potts_cell_sorting.lean L101–L193" ;
        dct:description "Pass 3 Theorems 4-6: target perimeter 12 s - 4, perimeter parity/cost identities, monotonicity above P_t (0 sorrys)" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/654cd6fc/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_042_cellular_potts_cell_sorting.lean#L101-L193> .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Gemini 4 Argon (primary assessor)" ;
        dct:identifier "gemini-4-argon" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf <https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4948-9192> ;
        foaf:homepage <https://deepmind.google> .
}

